cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the versioned companion repository when using this partial formalization."
type: software
title: "Dagger models in Lean: a partial formalization of Part I"
authors:
  - family-names: Akasaka
    given-names: Keima
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-01
url: "https://github.com/Yonoha/dagger-models-lean"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Yonoha/dagger-models-lean"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A partial Lean 4 formalization accompanying Models for dagger (infinity,1)-categories I:
  Dagger simplicial sets and unitary cores. Version 0.1.0 covers the reversal simplex
  category, dagger simplicial sets and elementary reversal lemmas, the definition of
  free cofibrations, and the vertex-level word obstruction. It does not formalize the
  main model-categorical theorems.
